    "body": "I think this bug is because the `path_vec` generation (generated after handling the git repo path) has a lot of hard code `/`. So if the `/` is replaced by `>`, the split won't do anything. So does starship have a document of the directory module about which should affect first? Like if the `/` is replaced by `>` effect first. Then the split should change the char it splitting with. ",
